{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THIS GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While searching for a missing student inside the Blackwood School, try to survive whatever is stalking you through the dark hallways.<br><strong>Silent Village</strong> is a narrative-driven psychological horror experience focused on exploration, environmental puzzles, and tension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dark corridors and follow light and sound clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles: keys, fuse boxes, chalk marks, locked doors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fragmented storytelling through notes, audio logs and objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic stalker AI that reacts to sight and sound.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings based on your choices.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration-focused psychological horror</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles with survival elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic stalker AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4\u20136 hour single-player experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turkish &amp; English UI/subtitles</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High tension, dark themes, sudden scare moments, oppressive atmosphere.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983170?t=1762278691","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983170?t=1762278691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983170/e0a5cb64d989646325d41def9a73f8c513766cb5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762278691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983170/e0a5cb64d989646325d41def9a73f8c51376